MID_SCXX_03_01_m01: <EDH>
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_001: Not too close to the arena, and not too far away.\nThis ought to work fine.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_002: Alright—let's do this according to plan. Remember,\nI'm a maiden who's been attacked by bandits.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_003: You'll pretend that you're just passing by, and then\ncall on the temple soldiers for help.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_004: Alright—let's do this according to plan. Remember,\nI'm a maiden who's been attacked by bandits.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_005: Your Majesty will pretend that you're just passing by,\nand then call on the temple soldiers for help.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_006: I will aid you. But would it not be simpler to cut\ndown some passerby?
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_007: Why would the queen of Saramis not handle this\nherself? I need no temple soldiers to dispatch them.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_008: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_009: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_010: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_011: You're making me feel uneasy about this... No,\nwe're here. We've got to see it through.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_012: Ahem. When the soldiers arrive, say that the bandits\nand the woman fled. Buy me some time.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_013: Basically, distract them while I sneak underground.\nIt all depends on you, alright? Let's begin!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_014: Ahem. When the soldiers arrive, say that the bandits\nand the woman fled. Buy me some time.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_015: Basically, distract them while I sneak underground.\nIt all depends on you, alright? Let's begin!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_016: Kyaaah!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_017: Ugh... So loud.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_018: Bandits are attacking my daughter! Where are the\ntemple soldiers when they are needed?!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_019: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_020: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_021: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_022: Oh no! Catch them at once!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_023: All according to plan! Now the only thing left to\ndo is... Hold on. What was that?
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_024: ROAR!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_025: AAAAH! Atlas bears!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_026: Huh?! What are atlas bears doing loose in the\nmiddle of the city?
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_027: You there! Can you help us capture those bears?\nWe were escorting them to the arena but, well...
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_028: there was this ear-piercing scream. They mistook it\nfor cheering and went completely out of control!
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_029: It was quite loud.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_030: Those responsible for mayhem must put an end to it.\nAnd a queen does not shirk her responsibilities.
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_031: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_032: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_033: 
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_034: Are you kidding me?! I really do NOT have time\nfor this...
MID_SCXX_03_01_m01_035: Fine! Let's make these rowdy animals behave.\nEven if that means knocking them out!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m01: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m01_001: Reinforcements ought to show up soon. Maybe I can\ntake advantage of the confusion...
MID_SCXX_03_02_m01_002: It's worth a shot, at least. I'm so close—he's almost in\nmy grasp!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m02: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m02_001: What's got you looking so excited? You do realize\nyour life is on the line, right?
MID_SCXX_03_02_m02_002: Death is not to be feared. It is never far.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m02_003: Forget I asked—focus on the fight. I need your help,\nbut that doesn't mean we'll see eye to eye.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m03: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m03_001: Apologies, Your Majesty. The queen of Saramis\nshouldn't be put in such a situation.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m03_002: I consider it a fine diversion. But do not forget your\nown purpose here.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m03_003: I couldn't forget it if I wanted to.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m04: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m04_001: Don't worry, I'm here to help! After all, I need to pay\nyou back for that balm!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m04_002: You think you owe me THIS for some skin balm?\nThat's...overkill. But I do appreciate it.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m05: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m05_001: You look like you're having fun. Are you a man who\nenjoys chaos, Talimun?
MID_SCXX_03_02_m05_002: No, no! I'm just curious how you'll fare against the\nWhite-Maned Demon, is all.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m05_003: Heh. Well, that's none of your business. It's mine\nand his.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m06: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m06_001: Now, Leda... I know you want to get to the\nWhite-Maned Demon. Talk to him first. You must.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m06_002: Of course, I'll talk to him. And then...I'll settle\nthe score.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m07: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m07_001: I've never seen creatures like these. What a shame\nwe're meant only to render them unconscious.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m07_002: You mean—you'd prefer we were hunting them?\nYou are one wild bride.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m08: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m08_001: OK, cub. You've slowed me down long enough.\nTime to go to sleep.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_001: Well done holding them off! We can back you up!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m10: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_002: Go. Your battlefield is elsewhere.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_003: Go. In Yu Phas's name, I vow to see the rest through.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_004: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_005: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_006: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_007: Alright. I'll go. But you'd better not die, alright?
MID_SCXX_03_02_m09_008: Alright. I'll go. But you'd better not die, alright?
MID_SCXX_03_02_m10_001: Finally, I will meet him again. See you shortly,\nWhite-Maned Demon!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11_001: Is that it? Is it ended?
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11_002: They have all been vanquished. We are fortunate\nthat no citizens perished in the chaos.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11_003: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11_004: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11_005: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11_006: Amazing! Atlas bears are so ferocious—but you\nknocked them out!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m11_007: Can't thank you enough for your help. Great work!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12_001: Gaaah!
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12_002: You are in the way. Shift.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12_003: Your training is woefully insufficient. If you cannot\nfight to my standards, then retreat.
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12_004: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12_005: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12_006: 
MID_SCXX_03_02_m12_007: My apologies! Please, defend this area in my stead!
MID_SCXX_03_02_e01: <TH>
MID_SCXX_03_02_e01_001: What is that? It looks like it's full of {SetColor=Gold}air{SetColor=Default}.
MID_SCXX_03_02_e01_002: I bet it'll {SetColor=Gold}explode if it's popped{SetColor=Default}...along with\n{SetColor=Gold}whatever's next to it{SetColor=Default}.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01: <EDH>
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_001: I cannot thank you enough! It's not much, but here's\na token of our appreciation.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_003: Animals can make worthy opponents.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_004: I accept. But in the future, take better care in\nmanaging your pet beasts.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_005: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_006: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_007: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_008: And with that, I take my leave. I'll need to report\nabout this to my superiors.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_009: You have returned. I can see from your eyes that you\ndid not kill him.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_010: Leda! You have returned. Did you and the\nWhite-Maned Demon...settle matters?
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_011: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_012: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_013: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_014: Yes. We talked. I'd intended to kill the man, but it\nturns out someone else had been manipulating him.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_015: If I'm to call my revenge complete, I have to expose\nthis other party first.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_016: After I do—I'll kill him. In the meantime, I'm happy\nto leave him trembling in fear.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_017: Yes. We talked. I'd intended to kill the man, but it\nturns out someone else had been manipulating him.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_018: If I'm to call my revenge complete, I have to expose\nthis other party first.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_019: After I do—I'll kill him. In the meantime, I'm happy\nto leave him trembling in fear.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_020: Hm.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_021: Ah.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_022: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_023: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_024: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_025: Anyway, I'm sorry for the trouble. I should probably\ndo something to repay you.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_026: Anyway, I am sorry for the trouble I caused you.\nI should probably do something to repay you.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_027: There is no need. I have already received something.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_028: Worry not. I have already been rewarded by the\ntemple soldiers.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_029: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_030: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_031: 
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_032: You're sure? Hmm. Well, in that case, allow me to\noffer you this.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_033: If you need anything, you can call on me,\nand I'll be there to help.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_034: You're sure? Hmm. Well, in that case, allow me to\noffer you this.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_035: If you need anything, you can call on me,\nand I'll be there to help.
MID_SCXX_03_03_m01_036: For now, my fight goes on. Bertrand... I will not allow\nyou to go and die without me there.